cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Late Stalinist Soviet Drama Corpus (1945–1953)"
message: "If you use the annotations, metadata, or code provided in this repository, please cite this repository."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Kolevatova"
    given-names: "Ekaterina"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPOSITORY"
abstract: >
  A digitised, TEI-encoded, lemmatised, and annotated corpus of
  46 Soviet plays written for adult audiences during the late
  Stalinist period (1945–1953), comprising 454,235 tokens.
keywords:
  - Soviet drama
  - late Stalinism
  - Russian literature
  - digital humanities
  - TEI
  - corpus linguistics
  - computational literary studies
